# CODEOWNERS STANDARD
# -------------------
#
# 01 — Every repository area has an owner.
#
# 02 — Infrastructure changes require review.
#
# 03 — Security-sensitive files remain explicitly owned.
#
# 04 — Branding sources remain protected.
#
# 05 — Database migrations remain reviewed.
#
# 06 — Workflow changes remain reviewed.
#
# 07 — Governance documents remain reviewed.
#
# 08 — New files inherit default ownership.
#
# 09 — Ownership may evolve as the project team grows.
#
# 10 — Responsibility remains clear.
